{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18768","headline":"寄陕州姚中丞 · 刘禹锡","name":"寄陕州姚中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月天气肃，二陵风雨收。\n旌旗阙下来，云日关东秋。\n禹迹想前事，汉台余故丘。\n俳徊襟带地，左右帝王州。\n留滞悲昔老，恩光荣彻侯。\n相思望棠树，一寄商声讴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}